	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Varia sunt et perplexa, quae nunciantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Utinam nostri <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>aliquando saperent; piscator ictus sapit, hi <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>toties icti ne nunc quidem sapere volunt.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nitor divina providentia, quae me unice sustentat; <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>scit ipse, quorsum haec omnia destinet.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Scribit d. <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><persName ref="p629">Coignetius</persName> et nunciat multa fausta; sed bonus vir <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>et ipse falsus est.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Rogo te, si quando ad eum scribis, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>meis verbis salvere eum iubeas siginificesque literas <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>eius mihi redditas.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nihil habeo, quod rescribam, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>et inanes mittere nolo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Tibi quoque mirum accidere <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>non debet, si rarius posthac scribo; quid enim hoc <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>unum toties scriberem me nihil habere, quod scribam, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>praesertim ad te alioquin occupatissimum.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Si quid <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>certi et digni habuero, officio meo non deero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Si tantum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>a te postulare debeo, rogo te, mi venerande pater, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>tu caeteris colophonem addas et veri aliquid <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>(quod iam deinceps constare omnino poterit) de <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>hoc incerto rerum eventu nos edoceas; ego bona <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>spe non destituor.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8093">Herculi</persName> tuas reddidi; nam hic est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Agit gratias, te cum tuis salvum cupit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Instant nuptiae <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>operosissimae, in quibus concionandum; ideo sum brevior.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Vale, reverende in Christo pater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Yetz, yetz ze aabet umb die 4 ist der <persName>fasel</persName> mit großem <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>pomp yngeritten, darunder vyl <placeName ref="l646">Glarner</placeName> und <persName ref="p8108">Gilg <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Tschudi</persName>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Bin ich von <persName ref="p1770">G[regorio] C[arlin]</persName>, mit dem mir 3 wort ze reden <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>kum wil worden, gewarnet, wie <persName ref="p8108">G[ilg] Tsch[udi]</persName> allein kommen, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ettwas mütery und pratick ze machen, und wie er <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>ein schryben schon yetz uff dem wäg ußgoßen, so im von <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>dem apt von <placeName ref="l970">Einsidlen</placeName> von <placeName ref="l1107">Trient</placeName> geschriben, wie <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>der <persName ref="p8315">Conde</persName> den <persName ref="p20225">Guisen</persName> den fuͦßfal thon und die sach <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ires theils in <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName> nunmee eroberet.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Doch <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>so werde ich schryben deren dingen halb von h[erren] landtaman <lb xml:id="p1z33"/><persName ref="p252">Bäldi</persName> han; den brieff bringt houptman <persName ref="p5342">Häßi</persName>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Literas, cum <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>haec scriberem, nondum accepi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Tu vigila, ut verum <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>habeamus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Quid <persName ref="p8108">Tsch[udius]</persName>spargat in nuptiis, omnia expiscabor <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>interim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Der apt von <placeName ref="l1618">Pfäfers</placeName> ist ouch hie.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Si <persName ref="p8315">Condensis</persName> opus haberet milite, velim omnino rationem haberi <persName ref="p1770">Carlini</persName>; <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>sunt huius consilii mei gravissimae causae.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Vellem et ad illum perscribi; velim simultati inte<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>r magnos viros nullam occasionem dari.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">20. iulii anno 1562.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p8009">F[abricius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Amplissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, d<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>. et patri suo in Christo reverendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
